# Line endings
#
# The pre-commit guard and the backup scripts run under /bin/sh on the Linux
# host. CRLF line endings make them fail with "bad interpreter", so these are
# pinned to LF regardless of any developer's core.autocrlf setting.
*.sh text eol=lf
.githooks/pre-commit text eol=lf
.githooks/* text eol=lf

# Normalise everything else to LF in the repository, check out per platform.
* text=auto

# Binary files that must never be line-ending translated.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
